polkit (the Rust crate)
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------

The native extension under ext/polkit links the polkit crate, Val Packett's
gir-generated binding over libpolkit-gobject-1. This gem is bindings for it and
nothing else: every module it defines speaks to a type of that crate.

