polkit (the C library)
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------

The crate above links libpolkit-gobject-1, part of polkit, the freedesktop.org
authorization framework. It is found by pkg-config at build time and is not
vendored here.

  https://github.com/polkit-org/polkit
  Copyright Red Hat, Inc. and contributors
  Licensed under the GNU Lesser General Public License, version 2.0 or later

LGPL-2.0-or-later is a weak copyleft: it governs libpolkit-gobject-1 itself and
reaches this work only as a dynamically linked library, which section 6 of that
licence permits. Nothing in this gem is derived from polkit's source. A
distributor shipping a precompiled gem that links it satisfies section 6 in the
ordinary way, by leaving the library replaceable rather than statically
absorbed.

